    Title for karus "[Party/Repeatable]Marauders of Darkland I"
    Title for elmorad "[Party/Repeatable]Marauders of Blue Feather Valley I"
    Repeat always
    Journal for karus "The quest to eradicate the Dragon Tooth Soldier is repeatable from Level 45 to Level 62. \n※  Premium account users will receive additional experience."
    Journal for elmorad "The quest to eradicate the Dragon Tooth Soldier is repeatable from Level 45 to Level 62. \n※  Premium account users will receive additional experience."
