    Give 1125000 experience or 2250000 with premium

direction_584 = location "Dragon Tooth Soldier" about "Dragon Tooth Soldier\nA monster created by Pathos in the Great War of Evil; possesses a conscience which is rare for an undead" found "El Morad" at 854 566 in zone 2
direction_585 = location "Dragon Tooth Soldier" about "Dragon Tooth Soldier\nA monster created by Pathos in the Great War of Evil; possesses a conscience which is rare for an undead" found "Karus" at 454 819 in zone 1

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Master, have you seen the village notice board in Linnart Village? Lots of quests... What're they all about?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master, have you seen the village notice board in Laiva Village? Lots of quests... What're they all about?"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "[Recently, many Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been seen west of Linnart Village in the Dark Lands]"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Recently, in the Dark Land west of Linnart Village, large numbers of  Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been sighted. They've been attacking and plundering the merchants coming from Moradon. Travellers are advised to avoid the Dark Lands untill the Dragon Teeth Sodlers have been cleared out.\n\n- Sentinel Hassan."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "[Recently, many Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been appearing southeast of Laiva Village in Blue Feather  Valley]"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Recently, in Blue Feather's Valley, southeast of Laiva Village, large numbers of  Dragon Tooth Solders have been sighted. They've been attacking and plundering the merchants coming from Moradon. Travellers are warned to steer clear of Blue Feather's Valley untill the Dragon Tooth Soldiers have been dealt with.\n\n                  - Sentinel Beth."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "(Monologue) Hmmm... are the Dark Lands west from here?"
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_585
    If player is elmorad
        Say "(Monologue) Hmm... is Blue Feather Valley southeast from here?"
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_584

On ready
    If player is karus
        Say "Hopefully the Dark Lands will quite-down for awhile. Master, you tried incredibly hard."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Blue Feather's Valley will become quite for some time? Master, you tried hard."
        Topic "Confirm" goto close
